    each of these effects of \"Nekroz of Areadbhair\" once per turn.\r\n\u25CF You
    can discard this card; Tribute up to 2 \"Nekroz\" monsters from your hand and/or
    field, and if you do, send that many \"Nekroz\" cards from your Deck to the GY.\r\n\u25CF
    When a monster effect is activated (Quick Effect): You can Tribute 1 monster
    from your hand or field; negate the activation, and if you do, banish that card."
